# Milestone-2 integration (X7): the D0 additions together in one session on the clean "linear" fixture, dark theme,
# 1280x720: the terminal panel running `git status`, Undo / Redo enabled after an operation (with its toast), the
# update notice in the bottom bar, the history popover over the open terminal, and Settings > Environment with the
# undo rows. Gitnuro's metrics must stay: tab strip 36, toolbar 64, panes 220 / centre / 330, bottom bar 32.
# The scenario creates a branch: run it against a fresh sandbox (new-sandbox.ps1 -Force) every time.
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
update serve 9.9.9 https://example.com/gitcthulhu/releases/v9.9.9
wait idle
open repository linear
wait idle
show terminal
wait idle
terminal input git status
wait terminal shows nothing to commit
assert terminal shows nothing to commit
undo demo branch x7-session
wait idle
shot x7-01-terminal-undo-notice
undo history open
wait idle
shot x7-02-history-over-terminal
undo history close
undo
wait idle
shot x7-03-after-undo-redo-enabled
hide terminal
wait idle
open settings page environment
wait idle
shot x7-04-settings-environment-undo
close dialog
assert no error
